{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A jobber buys an article at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aa9f30d0996bd6b2d77a717dd3d910b6b895466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> less <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/6842e01bf11a6e39ede0b296cc7a643ca0d4390b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\frac{1}{2}\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />. He then wishes to sell the article at a gain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/5/76527544aad50d85d37e8f6c60c1a2ff7aed9398.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33\\frac{1}{3}\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" /> of his cost \nafter allowing a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> discount on his marked price. At what price, in dollars, should the article be marked?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1bf70433dc67aa2289209fbdb872b7ba4fb53d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 25.20 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 30.00 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 33.60 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 40.00 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"564\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/6842e01bf11a6e39ede0b296cc7a643ca0d4390b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\frac{1}{2}\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" /> as a fraction is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db9e227e8177d26de452c2a2faeb6d45cc53d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, the jobber paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab187bbfa553b8817d84d0feb7bd3bb857e8b449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$24 \\cdot \\left(1 - \\frac{1}{8}\\right) = \\$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"164\" height=\"45\" /> for the article.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/5/76527544aad50d85d37e8f6c60c1a2ff7aed9398.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33\\frac{1}{3}\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" /> as a fraction is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, the jobber wishes to sell the article for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/9145a5de575b34fca89c486ca14c92325838d2b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$21 \\cdot \\left(1 + \\frac{1}{3}\\right) = \\$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"164\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the marked price of the item.  After a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> discount, the price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17a2fb4bcc6090bd04da6e4dbe232e0374589212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8x$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cf0ff57532377663e210468e4004d68cc37fe01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8x = \\$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5ba0a8077780af9fb4d983011bc03dc6bf95c49f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"16\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77f02753f9a328103e8713e63ba165e4d8e2d432.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n